        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight kind and communicative care from clinicians such as Dr. Przekop and veterinary nurse Holly Polk. Many clients appreciate doctors who explain treatments without applying sales pressure. Conversely, negative reviews cite rushed transactional attitudes and brief phone conversations during inquiries."
