      "title": {
        "en": "Transparent pricing alongside procedural costs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple clients commend the hospital for fair examination rates, clear cost estimates, and refusing to upsell unnecessary diagnostic tests. Routine checkup fees are viewed as reasonable by several pet parents. Nonetheless, other reviewers noted significant expenses for comprehensive imaging and repeat radiographs for injuries."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
