      "title": {
        "en": "Diagnostic assessments and patient outcomes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report positive medical recoveries from acute poisonings, eye infections, and urgent health conditions treated on the same day. Clients value thorough diagnostic workups that resolve uncomfortable symptoms in companion animals. However, one owner reported a missed diagnosis on leg imaging that required follow-up care elsewhere."
      }
    }
